        <h1>The Pomodoro Technique: What It Is <em>and How to Use It</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Work for 25 minutes, break for 5, and repeat. That is the Pomodoro Technique in a sentence, but the part that makes it work is the rule most people skip. Here is where the method came from, how to run it properly, what the research on breaks and interruptions actually shows, and how the Best Answer Hub Pomodoro Timer keeps your sessions on your own device.</p>
